# The autoinstall payload and the bootstrap script are read by Linux, not
# Windows. `user-data` embeds a shell heredoc whose terminator will NOT match
# if it carries a trailing \r — which silently drops the logind config, which
# is the line that stops the laptop from suspending when you close the lid.
# Keep these LF no matter what platform checks them out.
docs/selfhost/thinkpad/user-data text eol=lf
docs/selfhost/thinkpad/meta-data text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
